{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3421d849785be4547c29cc55186795a62204c0e2bfb1dc92090f5397ae4c761c","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"human-agent-society/coral@0123dfb939b3 snapshot c9eb36b50c78ec1e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_066b8863bece393d332b252ed173069f714ec446f0b0be73c2d5db5092f1b7bd","slc_3d7e2537be83990287253d0d33529eb52eb113e7ea06bfdab1977646ac0187f8"],"source_ids":["src_ddefbdc8cfb15952b64d02647a7d20e0"],"text":"A grader daemon polls pending attempt JSON files in agent worktrees, runs the grader, writes scores back, and performs cleanup; agents poll the same files until results appear.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3c42eba3b90e2d5ed14be93cc9b6303fc1ad7d4c0f725d506ef9d946705ce7c6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"human-agent-society/coral@0123dfb939b3 snapshot c9eb36b50c78ec1e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_7ca769b2c1de0d41e978da98d24b3ef16c4134d8fde9d1438f923bbe99f18c97","slc_c9369949e465d693e25247cd609461696527cec53f1ccf8d42ed256da9564981"],"source_ids":["src_53eb909ae7fc596e8104f84937ba24a1"],"text":"CORAL targets iterative code search where success is measurable by a programmatic metric or LLM rubric grader, spanning optimization, math, systems, and ML tasks; it is a framework around coding agents, not a coding model.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5afba1023faa04c595dba066a166b0d4ed44a956dd7754ce95cd299cbbb2b54d","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"human-agent-society/coral@0123dfb939b3 snapshot c9eb36b50c78ec1e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_68083ca56dda6a022c90e19f3e18dd5ab368f81e6fd0c08ba17effd34862b2a3","slc_a6ead4fe0de45ba6a1e8b717e01659cd7fb6cccb6f591770e829bad1bdb93361"],"source_ids":["src_ddefbdc8cfb15952b64d02647a7d20e0"],"text":"A web dashboard exposes a POST /api/steer endpoint that validates the manager is stopped, then queues a continue_from action or marks an attempt as user-best; coral resume applies queued actions, and coral resume --from creates an in-memory steering action.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","created_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_642ecc87f8d114510b4607622cddbb5cd26f19a1dd8564ff83e91bcd69aa67a1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"human-agent-society/coral@0123dfb939b3 snapshot c9eb36b50c78ec1e","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1f7c3c287fd29b1b3dd39ac6116c79fa5b403de558d82590b01815ee83ee5da9"],"source_ids":["src_aa242b07a9145b78970a5ad23a1cb1e5"],"text":"In Docker sessions the agent runs as an unprivileged user while the manager and grader stay root, preventing agents from reading .coral/private/ grader material; on the host this isolation is opt-in via agents.isolate_user.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:57:24Z","updated_by_operation":"op_2af64d625b21474f9bb084aa88c1dd00"}
